      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HUMPHREE BEAR (4) smart gelding who drops back to his preferred trip after giving his all for a game third over 1200m at Grafton. Gets the right run again and can stalk the good speed and finish over the top of these. RICH STAR (1) exciting five-year-old gelding going nicely through the grades. Won three straight last prep and resumed with a tough on-pace second over 1025m at Grafton. Has his share of talent and proven second up. Leading player with the claim. THE ROOKIE (6) is mixing her form and gets in light with Palmer's claim after running third over 1100m at Gatton. Kept fresh and looks to have genuine claims. TRYANZA (7) has been thereabouts of late and doesn't have to find much to win this. Ploughed through the heavy going with a tough second over 1250m at Ballina. Will appreciate the weight drop and not to be overlooked.",
